#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:5
#: 65d9f10acd114ae183f9631044b52bbf
msgid ""
"README: `1` HOME, `2` HOLD, `4` MOVEJ (canonical); `3` is a **legacy "
"MOVEJ alias** when this controller is standalone, and means **OCS2** on "
"mixed OCS2/WBC stacks"
msgstr ""
"README：`1` HOME、`2` HOLD、`4` MOVEJ（规范值）；本控制器独立运行时 `3` 是**遗留 MOVEJ "
"别名**，在混合 OCS2/WBC 栈上表示 **OCS2**"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:5
#: 92d4168290884beb855616d85e1be901
msgid "[OCS2 Arm Controller](../4-reference/controllers/2-ocs2_arm_controller.md)"
msgstr "[OCS2 Arm Controller](../4-reference/controllers/2-ocs2_arm_controller.md)"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:5
#: 7efa68ae3e3b43a58b18928869b3e877
msgid "HOME / OCS2 / HOLD"
msgstr "HOME / OCS2 / HOLD"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:5
#: b8a4baca0a114cd1806394ea2e9a67e3
msgid ""
"README integers: `1` HOME, `2` HOLD, `3` **OCS2**. Operators and "
"`ros2_robot_interface` send them on **`/fsm_command`**. Starts in HOLD; "
"OCS2 returns only to HOLD. Shared `FSMCommandPublisher` also defines `4` "
"MOVEJ"
msgstr ""
"README 整数：`1` HOME、`2` HOLD、`3` **OCS2**。操作员和 `ros2_robot_interface` 发到 "
"**`/fsm_command`**。从 HOLD 起步；OCS2 只能回到 HOLD。共用的 `FSMCommandPublisher` "
"还定义了 `4` MOVEJ"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:5
#: 8375c6b78c234d019a556337209efa59
msgid "[OCS2 WBC Controller](../4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md)"
msgstr "[OCS2 WBC Controller](../4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md)"

