#: 52031d39de604108bc0529b3b20cef09
msgid "全身 stack"
msgstr "全身栈"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:5
#: fc6d10c7a05544f38e586d07e7b186d1
msgid ""
"Private package; extra states are in that README after access. Public "
"Python still uses the same `/fsm_command` integers plus `/mode_command` "
"strings"
msgstr ""
"私有软件包；额外状态见开通后的该 README。公开 Python 仍使用同一套 `/fsm_command` 整数以及 "
"`/mode_command` 字符串"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:39
#: 72c3ab7247574667a861c0a2f725ffa2
msgid ""
"On mixed stacks, head / split-waist `basic_joint_controller` treats **`3`"
" and `4` as MOVEJ**, while the arm / WBC controller treats **`3` as "
"OCS2** and **`4` as MOVEJ**."
msgstr ""
"混合栈上，头部 / 分体腰部的 `basic_joint_controller` 把 **`3` 和 `4` 都当作 MOVEJ**；手臂 / "
"WBC 控制器则把 **`3` 当作 OCS2**、**`4` 当作 MOVEJ**。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:41
#: 8461c0d524c84e4c878410b54d4a9421
msgid ""
"The [ocs2_arm_controller README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/README.md)"
" still names `/control_input` for those 1/2/3 integers. That is **not** "
"the stack-wide FSM topic. Joystick `control_input` "
"(`arms_ros2_control_msgs/Inputs`) on `arms_target_manager` is a different"
" message: it is scaled into `/left_target/twist` / `/right_target/twist`."
msgstr ""
"[ocs2_arm_controller README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/README.md)"
" 仍把 1/2/3 这些整数写在 `/control_input` 上。那**不是**全栈 FSM "
"话题。`arms_target_manager` 上的手柄 "
"`control_input`（`arms_ros2_control_msgs/Inputs`）是另一种消息：按比例映射到 "
"`/left_target/twist` / `/right_target/twist`。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:43
#: 877830ae1516479582d35e98d694605f
msgid "ros2 topic pub --once /fsm_command std_msgs/msg/Int32 \"data: 2\"   # HOLD"
msgstr "ros2 topic pub --once /fsm_command std_msgs/msg/Int32 \"data: 2\"   # HOLD"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:47
#: c03298bd4b7740029f6b6e3e22bde3f1
msgid ""
"Split vs whole-body launches (and the Lift2S `quick_start` **split body**"
" / **full body** menu) are on [分体控制 vs 全身控制](7-split_vs_wbc.md). Teleop "
"is a separate interface, not an extra FSM state — [Isomorphic "
"Teleop](../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md)."
msgstr ""
"分体 vs 全身 launch（以及 Lift2S `quick_start` 的 **分体** / **全身** 菜单）见 [分体控制 vs "
"全身控制](7-split_vs_wbc.md)。遥操作是另一套接口，不是额外 FSM "
"状态——[同构遥操作](../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md)。"

