msgid ""
"Names below are those the public "
"[ros2_robot_interface](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/ros2_robot_interface) config and API_REFERENCE subscribe / publish, "
"plus the public controller READMEs. `connect()` rewrites split vs WBC "
