#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:86
#: 6036bd23c4ff4557a15c4481d02257dc
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`relative` uses **TwistStamped**: `twist` is a displacement increment, "
"not a velocity. Non-base `frame_id` rotates `linear` / `angular` into "
"base before composing. `twist` stays a bare `Twist` (velocity, base "
"only). `angular.{x,y,z}` is roll / pitch / yaw (`R' = "
"RΔ(yaw)·RΔ(pitch)·RΔ(roll)·R`)."
msgstr ""
"`relative` 使用 **TwistStamped**：`twist` 是位移增量，不是速度。非 base 的 `frame_id` 会先把"
" `linear` / `angular` 旋到 base 再合成。`twist` 话题仍是裸 "
"`Twist`（速度语义，仅基座）。`angular.{x,y,z}` 对应 roll / pitch / yaw（合成：`R' = "
"RΔ(yaw)·RΔ(pitch)·RΔ(roll)·R`）。"

