"路径（`full_body.launch.py`，`body_target_enabled`）。**分体**（`split_body.launch.py`）用"
" "
"[basic_joint_controller](../4-reference/controllers/7-basic_joint_controller.md)"
" 的关节话题驱动腰部（`/body_joint_controller/target_joint_position` 等），不是这组话题。"

