"the same gate and hides the marker. `split_body` does not turn this "
"marker on. 分体 head joints stay on "
"`/head_joint_controller/target_joint_position`."
msgstr ""
"WBC 头部 XYZ+RPY。FSM 为 **OCS2** 且 `WbcCurrentState.head_state` 为 "
"**`HEAD_TRACKING`** 时，`arms_target_manager` 才插入六维 marker。离开该模式会移除 "
"marker。`HEAD_GAZE`（中点注视）走同一门控并隐藏 marker。`split_body` 不会打开这个 "
"marker。分体头部关节仍走 `/head_joint_controller/target_joint_position`。"

